            <div xml:id="d410">

                <pb facs="1041" n="1029" sameAs="frus:frus1945v02/pg1029"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.50 UNRRA/9–1045: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-09-21T20:00:00-04:00">September 21,
                            1945—8 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>252. Reur 330 September 10. Department has taken up with Governor Lehman problem
                    of UNRRA mission in Zecho giving color to reports that UNRRA deliveries are
                    gifts from Soviet Union. Lehman stated that he would take immediate steps to see
                    that this situation was corrected. It might at the same time be appropriate for
                    you to raise this same point with officials of Zecho Govt if you believe Zecho
                    Govt might assist in informing the Zecho public on true situation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
